WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.590
Hi, I'm Hazel. I help you understand your money.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:09.310
I explain your first paycheck, how to make a simple budget, and how student loans work.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:14.650
For example, ask me: why is my paycheck smaller than I expected?
